00:40:17.030 --> 00:40:20.480
Most of this cost is actually
driven by what BigQuery uses

00:40:20.480 --> 00:40:22.610
and what Bigtable costs.

00:40:22.610 --> 00:40:25.880
So the rest of all
that streaming,

00:40:25.880 --> 00:40:28.460
the storage on Cloud Storage,
Pub/Sub, all that stuff,

00:40:28.460 --> 00:40:31.220
actually is not a significant
